OL,3,GNEWSA'Jersey helped me get my
OL,4,Aindependence back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with dwarfism says Jersey has
OL,7,F"rapidly all contributed to get my
OL,8,Findependence back" after a successful
OL,9,Fcrowdfunding campaign.
OL,11,FCaroline Fry, 52, raised more than
OL,12,F#6,000 to help pay for a new specialist
OL,13,Fvehicle she said she needed to drive
OL,14,Faround after her previous van stopped
OL,15,Fworking.
OL,17,FShe said: "Maybe this will encourage
OL,18,Fother people to speak up and seek
OL,19,Fsupport... I have so much gratitude to
OL,20,Feverybody that's pitched in to help
OL,21,Fsomething because it's so important to
OL,22,Fme to get my life back on the road."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
